Keep a shared words as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared order as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared used as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place "catg" into words.
Place "ctaagt" into words.
Place "gcta" into words.
Place 0 into used.
Place 0 into used.
Place 0 into used.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared answer as empty text.
Keep a shared shortest as 0.
Keep a shared word as empty text.
Keep a shared overlap as 0.
Keep a shared agree as 0.

To check from span (a whole number).
Set agree to 1.
The last is the last position of current.
The width is last plus 1.
The begin is width minus span.
For every offset from 0 to span minus 1.
The actual is character (begin plus offset) of current.
The wanted is character offset of word.
If actual is not wanted, set agree to 0, stop.

To match.
The last is the last position of current.
The width is last plus 1.
The final is the last position of word.
The reach is final plus 1.
The limit is the smaller of width and reach.
Set overlap to 0.
For every span from 1 to limit.
Check from span.
If agree is 1, set overlap to span.

To join from place (a whole number).
The chosen is item place of order.
The next is item chosen of words.
Set word to next.
Match.
The last is the last position of word.
The reach is last plus 1.
The tail is the slice of word from overlap to reach.
Place tail into current.

To assess.
The first is item 0 of order.
The seed is item first of words.
Set current to seed.
For every place from 1 to 2, Join from place.
The close is the last position of current.
The width is close plus 1.
The copy is a copy of current.
If shortest is 0 or width is less than shortest, set shortest to width, set answer to copy.

To take from spot (a whole number) with depth (a whole number).
Place spot into order.
Set item spot of used to 1.
Arrange from depth plus 1.
Remove the last item from order.
Set item spot of used to 0.

To arrange from depth (a whole number).
If depth is 3, Assess, return.
For every spot from 0 to 2, if item spot of used is 0, Take from spot with depth.

Arrange from 0.
Show answer.
